Caret movement within and across cells (design 3.1, 3.3).

=== Down on the last line goes to the insertion point below; again into the next cell keeping the column
--- before
#% cell
ab▮c

#% cell
xyz
--- keys
Down
--- after
#% cell
abc

‖
#% cell
xyz

=== Down twice reaches the next cell at the same column
--- before
#% cell
ab▮c

#% cell
xyz
--- keys
Down Down
--- after
#% cell
abc

#% cell
xy▮z

=== Up mirrors Down
--- before
#% cell
abc

#% cell
x▮yz
--- keys
Up Up
--- after
#% cell
a▮bc

#% cell
xyz

=== Up and Down move between lines inside a cell, keeping the goal column
--- before
#% cell
abc
d▮
efgh
--- keys
Down End Up Up
--- after
#% cell
abc▮
d
efgh

=== Right at the end goes to the insertion point after the cell, then into the next one
--- before
#% cell
a▮

#% cell
b
--- keys
Right Right
--- after
#% cell
a

#% cell
▮b

=== Left at the start goes to the insertion point before the cell
--- before
#% cell
a

#% cell
▮b
--- keys
Left
--- after
#% cell
a

‖
#% cell
b

=== movement skips Message cells
--- before
#% cell label=1
1 +
#% output
#! error
‖

#% cell
x
--- keys
Up
--- after
#% cell label=1
1 +
#% output
#! error
‖

#% cell
x

=== Ctrl+Home and Ctrl+End
--- before
#% cell
a▮

#% cell
b
--- keys
Ctrl+End
--- after
#% cell
a

#% cell
b
‖

=== Ctrl+Home goes before the first cell
--- before
#% cell
a

#% cell
b▮
--- keys
Ctrl+Home
--- after
‖
#% cell
a

#% cell
b

=== word motion
--- before
#% cell
▮f(aa + b)
--- keys
Ctrl+Right Ctrl+Right Ctrl+Right Ctrl+Right
--- after
#% cell
f(aa + ▮b)

=== Shift extends the selection; Left collapses it to its start
--- before
#% cell
a▮bcd
--- keys
Shift+Right Shift+Right
--- after
#% cell
a⟦bc⟧d

=== Left collapses a selection to its start
--- before
#% cell
a⟦bc⟧d
--- keys
Left
--- after
#% cell
a▮bcd

=== Home and End
--- before
#% cell
ab▮c
--- keys
Home "<" End ">"
--- after
#% cell
<abc>▮

=== Shift+Down at an insertion point selects the next cell; again extends
--- before
‖
#% text
# a

#% text
# b
--- keys
Shift+Down Shift+Down
--- after
#% text ◆
# a

#% text ◆
# b

=== clicking between cells sets the insertion point
--- before
#% cell
a▮

#% cell
b
--- keys
Gap(1)
--- after
#% cell
a

‖
#% cell
b

=== Up from an insertion point goes into the output above
--- before
#% cell label=1
1
#% output n=1
#= 1
‖
--- keys
Up
--- after
#% cell label=1
1
#% output n=1
#= ▮1
